---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="The Shop" description="NorthWest Tactical Knives is a full-service knife shop in Lynnwood, WA and the largest SOG authorized dealer in the Northwest — owned and run by master sharpener Gio Guajardo.">

  <section class="phead">
    <div class="container">
      <span class="eyebrow">The shop</span>
      <h1 class="phead-title">A real knife shop,<br /><span class="accent">run by a real sharpener.</span></h1>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Story -->
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container story-grid">
      <div class="story-media">
        <img src="/images/owner-gio.jpg" alt="Gio Guajardo behind the counter at NorthWest Tactical Knives in Lynnwood, WA" width="1200" height="900" loading="lazy" />
        <span class="story-tag spec">Gio Guajardo · Owner &amp; sharpener</span>
      </div>
      <div class="story-text">
        <p class="lead">
          NorthWest Tactical Knives is a full-service knife store in Lynnwood, Washington —
          tactical, outdoor, and everyday blades, backed by more than a decade of hands-on
          sharpening and repair.
        </p>
        <p>
          Owner Gio Guajardo built the shop around a simple idea: a knife is only as good as
          its edge, and most people have never felt what their blade is actually capable of.
          So every knife that crosses the counter — a $20 pocket folder or a collector-grade
          fixed blade — gets the same careful factory edge, set by hand.
        </p>
        <p>
          Along the way the shop became the largest SOG authorized dealer in the Northwest,
          with the deepest selection of folders, fixed blades, tomahawks, tools, and gear in
          the region — plus authorized SOG repair and custom engraving under the same roof.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Stat strip -->
  <section class="stat-band">
    <div class="container stat-grid">
      <div class="stat"><span class="stat-num">10+</span><span class="stat-label">Years sharpening &amp; repairing</span></div>
      <div class="stat"><span class="stat-num">#1</span><span class="stat-label">SOG dealer in the Northwest</span></div>
      <div class="stat"><span class="stat-num">Every</span><span class="stat-label">Edge set by hand</span></div>
      <div class="stat"><span class="stat-num">M–F</span><span class="stat-label">Open 10:00 – 5:30</span></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Storefront + values -->
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container values-grid">
      <div class="values-media">
        <img src="/images/storefront.jpg" alt="The NorthWest Tactical Knives storefront window — SOG Authorized Dealer" width="1200" height="900" loading="lazy" />
      </div>
      <div class="values-text">
        <span class="eyebrow">What you can count on</span>
        <h2 class="section-title">No counter theater.</h2>
        <ul class="values-list">
          <li><strong>Straight answers.</strong> The person selling you the knife is the one who sharpens and carries them. Ask anything.</li>
          <li><strong>Honest edges.</strong> No over-grinding to look busy. Just a clean, correct edge that lasts.</li>
          <li><strong>Fair pricing.</strong> Sharpening starts at $13. Most jobs are done while you shop.</li>
          <li><strong>The real SOG lineup.</strong> Authorized dealer and repair — not a display of leftovers.</li>
        </ul>
        <a href="/contact" class="btn btn-outline">Come by the shop →</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Visit CTA -->
  <section class="visit">
    <div class="container visit-inner">
      <h2 class="visit-title">Stop in and say hey.</h2>
      <p class="visit-sub">The shop recently moved — call or text before your first visit and Gio will point you to the door.</p>
      <div class="visit-facts">
        <div class="vf"><span class="vf-label">Hours</span><span class="vf-val">Mon–Fri · 10:00–5:30</span></div>
        <div class="vf"><span class="vf-label">Call or text</span><a class="vf-val" href="tel:+14255990661">425-599-0661</a></div>
        <div class="vf"><span class="vf-label">Where</span><span class="vf-val">Lynnwood, WA</span></div>
      </div>
      <a href="/contact" class="btn btn-primary">Hours, directions &amp; contact →</a>
    </div>
  </section>

</Layout>

<style>
  .phead { padding: 4.5rem 0 3rem; }
  .phead-title { font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 6vw, 4.5rem); line-height: 0.96; margin-top: 1rem; }

  .story-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 0.95fr 1.05fr; gap: 3.5rem; align-items: center; }
  .story-media { position: relative; }
  .story-media img { width: 100%; border: 1px solid var(--line-gold); border-radius: 3px; display: block; }
  .story-tag { position: absolute; left: 0.9rem; bottom: 0.9rem; background: rgba(11,14,16,0.9); }
  .story-text { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 1.1rem; }
  .story-text p:not(.lead) { color: var(--dim); font-size: 0.98rem; line-height: 1.75; }

  .stat-band { background: var(--pine); border-top: 1px solid var(--line-gold); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line-gold); }
  .stat-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); gap: 1.5rem; padding: 3rem 2rem; }
  .stat { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0.5rem; text-align: center; }
  .stat-num { font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 4vw, 3rem); font-weight: 800; color: var(--brass); line-height: 1; letter-spacing: 0.01em; }
  .stat-label { font-size: 0.82rem; color: var(--dim); letter-spacing: 0.02em; }

  .values-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.05fr 0.95fr; gap: 3.5rem; align-items: center; }
  .values-media img { width: 100%; border: 1px solid var(--line-gold); border-radius: 3px; display: block; }
  .values-text { display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-start; gap: 1.3rem; }
  .values-list { list-style: none; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 1rem; }
  .values-list li { font-size: 0.95rem; color: var(--dim); line-height: 1.6; padding-left: 1.25rem; position: relative; }
  .values-list li::before { content: ""; position: absolute; left: 0; top: 0.55em; width: 8px; height: 8px; background: var(--brass); transform: rotate(45deg); }
  .values-list strong { color: var(--bone); font-weight: 600; }

  .visit { background: var(--ink2); border-top: 1px solid var(--line); }
  .visit-inner { padding: 4.5rem 2rem; text-align: center; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; gap: 1.1rem; }
  .visit-title { font-size: clamp(2rem, 4.5vw, 3.25rem); }
  .visit-sub { color: var(--muted); font-size: 1rem; max-width: 50ch; }
  .visit-facts { display: flex; gap: 2.5rem; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: center; margin: 1rem 0 1.5rem; }
  .vf { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0.3rem; }
  .vf-label { font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.66rem; letter-spacing: 0.18em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--brass); }
  .vf-val { font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: 1.15rem; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.03em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--bone); text-decoration: none; }
  a.vf-val:hover { color: var(--brass); }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .story-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 2rem; }
    .story-media { order: -1; }
    .stat-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); gap: 2rem 1rem; }
    .values-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 2rem; }
    .values-media { order: -1; }
    .visit-facts { gap: 1.75rem; }
  }
</style>
